      choices: ['The angle of incoming solar radiation is more direct at low latitudes, concentrating energy over a smaller surface area.', 'Low latitudes are closer to the Sun than high latitudes.', 'The atmosphere is thinner at the equator, allowing more radiation to reach the surface.', 'Ocean currents carry more solar energy to equatorial regions.'],
